1
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:04,640
早上好 总统女士
Good morning, Madam President.

2
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:06,930
请允许我向您介绍爪洼国大使
May I introduce you to the Ambassador of Java?

3
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:08,670
多谢
Oh, thank you.

4
00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:11,200
因为追根究底 旅行水杯
Because, after all, what is a travel mug

5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,920
就是你装咖啡的橱柜
but a closet for your coffee?

6
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:15,520
很好 这就是我们下一轮营销方式了
And boom, our next promotional giveaway.

7
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:18,460
你要是穿上高领毛衣和牛仔裤
Throw on a black turtleneck and some mom jeans,

8
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:20,450
我会感觉自己娶了史蒂夫·乔布斯
it's like I'm married to Steve Jobs.

9
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:22,140
我听到你昨晚发邮件
I did hear you banging out e-mails

10
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:23,330
发到了很晚
till all hours last night,

11
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:25,800
所以三明治里的黄瓜片还能用来
so the cucumbers in the sandwich can be repurposed

12
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,560
在午休时间消除鱼尾纹
as lunchtime crow's-feet refreshers.

13
00:00:27,570 --> 00:00:28,480
谢谢
Thank you.

14
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:29,820
别忘了晚点有个酒会
Don't forget we've got drinks later.

15
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:32,460
好 有没有什么玩笑不能开的
Right. Any specific joke areas I should stay away from?

16
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:33,510
没有 不用担心
Oh, no, don't worry about it.

17
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:36,130
主要是我和其他人聊工作
It's mostly just me and the guys talking business.

18
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:38,550
我给你报的单车健身课你去上了吗
Hey, you using those spin classes I got you?

19
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:40,100
我上周去了两次呢
Yeah. I went twice last week.

20
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:41,180
看不出来吗
You can't tell?

21
00:00:41,530 --> 00:00:42,610
当然能
Sure, I can.

22
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:45,330
接手老爸公司最棒的一点在于
The best part about taking over my dad's company --

23
00:00:45,590 --> 00:00:50,200
我成了一个大权在握的白人男性 我爱这感觉
I am now a powerful white male, and I love it.

24
00:00:50,770 --> 00:00:53,310
我现在完全能体会为什么我们不希望
I totally get now why we don't want anyone else

25
00:00:53,310 --> 00:00:54,580
其他族群拥有我们拥有的这一切
to have what we have.

26
00:00:54,590 --> 00:00:57,160
亲爱的 在我去上班之前
Honey, before I take off for work,

27
00:00:57,200 --> 00:01:00,830
我看到了这个 然后想到了你
I saw this and I thought of you.

28
00:01:02,650 --> 00:01:03,710
这是什么
What is it?

29
00:01:04,130 --> 00:01:05,030
是一把钥匙
It's a key?

30
00:01:05,030 --> 00:01:06,040
没错
Yeah, it is.

31
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:07,220
是一把钥匙
It is a key...

32
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:11,890
但这是什么的钥匙呢
but a key to what?

33
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:15,730
不是吧
No!

34
00:01:16,300 --> 00:01:17,430
不是吧
No!

35
00:01:17,820 --> 00:01:19,260
你给我买了个平衡车
You got me a PhunkeeDuck?!

36
00:01:19,260 --> 00:01:22,260
我的男人不再需要走路了 笨蛋才走路
No more walking for my man. Walking's for jerks.

37
00:01:22,330 --> 00:01:25,120
天哪 有史以来最棒的礼物
Oh, my God! That is the best gift ever!

38
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:28,200
管它会去到哪里 我出发了
I don't know where it stops and I begin!

39
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:43,320
在哪里 在哪里
Where is it? Where is it?

40
00:01:43,320 --> 00:01:46,090
这些奶酪块一周比一周小了
You know, these cheese cubes keep getting smaller every week.

41
00:01:46,090 --> 00:01:48,520
我得开始保留样本证明这一点了
I should start saving these to prove my point.

42
00:01:49,220 --> 00:01:50,660
退休以后居然闲到这种程度
Wow, am I retired.

43
00:01:51,380 --> 00:01:52,130
在那里
It's there!

44
00:01:52,130 --> 00:01:53,630
太美了
It's beautiful!

45
00:01:54,130 --> 00:01:55,090
穿得有点暴露了
A little revealing.

46
00:01:55,090 --> 00:01:57,480
我能理解利用性感来制造辣酱的卖点
I mean, I get using sex to sell your hot sauce.

47
00:01:57,480 --> 00:02:00,050
这也是为何我以前拍橱柜广告要穿约达西牛仔裤
That's why I wore Jordache jeans in my old closet ads.

48
00:02:00,050 --> 00:02:02,200
这也有点太过了吧
But a little much, isn't it?

49
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:03,680
效果显然很好
It's obviously working.

50
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:05,270
店里跟我说他们摆出来一百瓶酱
The store said that they put out

51
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:08,920
现在已经卖掉一半了
100 bottles of my sauce, and half of them are gone!

52
00:02:10,730 --> 00:02:11,760
天哪
Oh, my.

53
00:02:11,970 --> 00:02:13,520
爱丽丝姑姑
Auntie Alice!

54
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:15,690
她是辣酱业的传说
She's a hot-sauce legend.

55
00:02:15,690 --> 00:02:17,140
她家的丙级辣酱
Her Level Three Sauce

56
00:02:17,140 --> 00:02:19,770
宣传画是一只爆炸的公鸡
has a picture of a rooster exploding.

57
00:02:19,770 --> 00:02:21,350
我得去见见她
I have to go meet her.

58
00:02:21,350 --> 00:02:23,850
快过来 照张相
Hey, guys, take a pic.

59
00:02:24,620 --> 00:02:27,300
滚一边去 这是我的老婆
Hey, get out of here! That's my wife!

60
00:02:27,910 --> 00:02:29,460
我是你的超级粉丝
I am a huge fan.

61
00:02:29,470 --> 00:02:33,400
您瓶罐上的人生故事我读了超多遍
I have read your life story on your label a thousand times.

62
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:36,060
您父亲真的开着装辣椒的卡车
Is it true that your father crashed his pepper truck

63
00:02:36,060 --> 00:02:39,200
撞上了木瓜树 因此开启了一代传奇吗
into a papaya tree and the legend was born?

64
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:41,810
你还问我什么事是真的吗
You're asking me if something's real?

65
00:02:41,810 --> 00:02:45,850
我不敢相信那块人形板真的是个人
I can't believe that that cutout's an actual person.

66
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,710
迈尔斯
Miles?

67
00:02:50,710 --> 00:02:52,200
你好 杰
Oh, hey, Jay.

68
00:02:52,490 --> 00:02:54,910
我想看看这条短信
Uh, trying to read a text.

69
00:02:54,910 --> 00:02:56,090
这边灯光被调得很暗
They keep the lights in here so low

70
00:02:56,090 --> 00:02:57,960
这样就不用把旧货撤下来了
so they don't have to rotate the produce.

71
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:58,890
少扯了
Don't give me that.

72
00:02:58,890 --> 00:02:59,880
不好意思
I'm sorry, man.

73
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:02,090
雷妮塔离开以后我一直很寂寞
I've been lonely since Reynetta left.

74
00:03:02,090 --> 00:03:03,250
去你的
You're a deacon.

75
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:06,320
亲爱的 帮我按按脚
Honey, foot rub.

76
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:07,450
不要
Pass.

77
00:03:08,210 --> 00:03:10,140
好吧 又来了
Okay, there it is again!

78
00:03:10,220 --> 00:03:12,950
我告诉你 楼上肯定在搞什么奇怪的事
I'm telling you, something weird is going on up there.

79
00:03:12,950 --> 00:03:15,770
我们把楼上的房间出租好赚点外快
We're renting our upstairs unit to earn a little extra cash

80
00:03:15,770 --> 00:03:18,380
也给我们的婚姻添一丝紧张感
and add a little extra tension to our marriage.

81
00:03:18,380 --> 00:03:19,890
现在的租客自称是
Our current guests registered

82
00:03:19,890 --> 00:03:23,610
威尔克森夫妇及汤米
as Mr. And Mrs. Wilkerson and Tommy.

83
00:03:23,610 --> 00:03:26,810
我以为是一对带小男孩的年轻夫妇
I was expecting a nice young couple and their little boy.

84
00:03:29,110 --> 00:03:30,150
你好 你们
Hello. You --

85
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:33,720
你们肯定就是威尔克森夫妇了吧
So, you -- You must be Mr. And Mrs. Wilkerson?

86
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:35,420
-没错 -那你就是汤米了
- That's right. - So you're Tommy?

87
00:03:35,420 --> 00:03:36,240
正是
He is.

88
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,180
欢迎
Welcome.

89
00:03:37,180 --> 00:03:39,240
小卡 我们去帮他们搬东西
Cam, let's help them with their trunk.

90
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,040
不用
No!

91
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:43,780
不用吗 好吧 这是钥匙
No? Okay, well, uh, here is the key.

92
00:03:43,780 --> 00:03:45,260
-给 -谢谢
- Here you are. - Thank you.

93
00:03:45,340 --> 00:03:46,280
汤米
Tommy?

94
00:03:48,730 --> 00:03:51,720
这算怎么回事
Okay, what is that all about?

95
00:03:51,810 --> 00:03:52,990
三个成年人
I mean, three adults?

96
00:03:52,990 --> 00:03:54,360
汤米为什么没有姓
Why doesn't Tommy have a last name?

97
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:56,750
汤米为什么不说话 他是人质吗
Why doesn't Tommy talk? Is he their captive?

98
00:03:56,750 --> 00:03:58,210
还是说人质其实是威尔克森太太
Is Mrs. Wilkerson their captive?

99
00:03:58,210 --> 00:03:59,360
还是说人质其实在车的后备箱
Is the captive in the trunk?

100
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,840
所以一定要有人质吗
So there has to be a captive?

101
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:03,070
最近 有些租客给了我们
Lately, we've been getting negative reviews

102
00:04:03,070 --> 00:04:04,730
-负面评价 -直说吧
- from some of our renters. - Say it.

103
00:04:04,730 --> 00:04:06,900
他们都提到一个共同的问题
And they tend to follow the common theme

104
00:04:06,900 --> 00:04:09,860
"大个子"喜欢八卦
that the "Bigger one" is "Nosy".

105
00:04:09,870 --> 00:04:12,760
而其他人说"橙发的家伙"
While others say the "Orange fella"

106
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:14,920
很冷漠不友好
is "Standoffish and cold."

107
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:15,610
谁说的
Who says that?

108
00:04:15,610 --> 00:04:16,930
我刚说的
I'm saying it now.

109
00:04:19,310 --> 00:04:20,870
好吧 我们得弄清楚到底怎么一回事
Okay, we need to find out what that is.

110
00:04:20,880 --> 00:04:22,510
小卡 不要去管他们好吗
Cam, stay out of their business, all right?

111
00:04:22,510 --> 00:04:24,040
要是我们的评价掉到三颗星以下
If we drop below three stars,

112
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,920
就只能租给烟鬼
we're gonna be stuck renting to chain smokers

113
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:28,380
或者想来美国生小孩的外国孕妇了
and pregnant foreigners trying to have their babies in America.

114
00:04:28,820 --> 00:04:30,920
记好时间 我开始变身成我爸了
Mark down the time. I just turned into my father.

115
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:31,840
我要上去
I'm going up.

116
00:04:31,840 --> 00:04:32,860
小卡
Cam...

117
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:36,060
小卡 你在干什么
Cam, what are you doing?!

118
00:04:36,060 --> 00:04:38,360
我去看看我们的租客
I am checking on our guests.

119
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:40,200
你们好 三位都好
Hello! Oh, all three of you.

120
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:42,200
我就是过来看看你们是不是需要
Uh, just stopped by to see if you guys need

121
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:43,670
一些干净的 干净的毛巾
some fresh -- fresh towels.

122
00:04:43,670 --> 00:04:45,440
我们不需要 谢谢
We're fine, thank you.

123
00:04:45,970 --> 00:04:47,760
你是有什么话要说吗
Uh, yes, you were gonna say something?

124
00:04:48,910 --> 00:04:49,520
你也看到了对吧
You saw that, right?

125
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:51,770
威尔克森太太朝我做了个痛苦的表情
Mrs. Wilkerson was giving me the distress signal.

126
00:04:51,770 --> 00:04:52,610
她刚刚这样...
She was like...

127
00:04:53,580 --> 00:04:54,630
拜托
Come on.

128
00:04:56,190 --> 00:04:56,950
小卡
Cam!

129
00:04:56,950 --> 00:04:58,720
又是我们 就是想再来看看
Us again. Just triple-checking

130
00:04:58,720 --> 00:05:00,240
你们是不是需要肥皂
to see if you need some hand soap,

131
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:02,430
单独跟我俩其中一个讲话 或者蛋糕
a chance to talk to one of us alone, some muffins.

132
00:05:02,430 --> 00:05:05,030
我们真的不需要 你不用一直过来问
Really, we're fine. You don't have to keep checking.

133
00:05:05,090 --> 00:05:06,110
阿嚏[救命]
Help!

134
00:05:07,830 --> 00:05:08,850
她说的不是救命
She did not say "Help."

135
00:05:08,850 --> 00:05:10,040
看来你听到了
So you did hear it.

136
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:15,450
胖子 替我谢谢你妈给我弄的新壁纸
Hey, Delgado, thank your mom for my new screen saver.

137
00:05:15,450 --> 00:05:16,620
我会的 帕克
Will do, Parker.

138
00:05:16,620 --> 00:05:18,280
说到二维纸板做的女人
And speaking of two-dimensional women

139
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:19,970
刚好对酱料又略懂一二
who know a thing or two about sauce,

140
00:05:19,970 --> 00:05:22,520
你路过弗拉纳根酒吧时也替我问你妈好
stop by Flanagan's and say hi to your mom for me.

141
00:05:25,890 --> 00:05:27,880
我知道你是因为那个人形板不开心
I know you were bothered by that cutout.

142
00:05:28,730 --> 00:05:30,170
但是所有青少年都有被嘲笑的时候
But every teenager gets teased,

143
00:05:30,170 --> 00:05:31,530
你得克服这种感觉 这样
and you have to rise above it, so --

144
00:05:31,530 --> 00:05:33,270
-你妈在后备箱里 -什么
- Your mother's in the trunk. - What?

145
00:05:33,270 --> 00:05:35,280
我受不了那些垂涎的眼神还有猥琐的自拍
I couldn't stand the ogling and the selfies,

146
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:36,890
所以我 为了我们俩把那人形板偷出来了
so I stole it -- for both our sakes.

147
00:05:36,890 --> 00:05:37,620
我们俩是一伙儿的
We're in this together.

148
00:05:37,620 --> 00:05:38,800
怎么会 我可没偷它出来
How? I didn't steal it.

149
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,720
我知道这是怎么回事了
Oh, I see where this is going.

150
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:43,970
你抱怨个没完 然后我把问题解决了
You complain and complain, I make the problem go away,

151
00:05:43,980 --> 00:05:45,010
你就过河拆桥
and you had nothing to do with it.

152
00:05:45,020 --> 00:05:46,560
我又没让你这么做 都是你自己的想法
I didn't ask for this. I didn't ask for any of this.

153
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:49,620
别起内讧了 会让我们掉以轻心的
Let's not turn on each other. It'll make us sloppy.

154
00:05:49,660 --> 00:05:51,320
我需要你帮忙处理掉它
I need your help to get rid of it.

155
00:05:52,010 --> 00:05:53,930
我已经努力尝试过了
God knows I've already tried.

156
00:06:01,130 --> 00:06:02,350
我了个
Son of a...

157
00:06:11,070 --> 00:06:12,350
我了个
Son of a...

158
00:06:12,900 --> 00:06:15,760
亚洲新推了很多很棒的收纳方案 是吧
A lot of cool storage solutions coming out of Asia, huh?

159
00:06:15,760 --> 00:06:16,640
是的 的确是
Yeah, there really are.

160
00:06:16,640 --> 00:06:18,250
但是我觉得你会对
But I think you might be even more interested

161
00:06:18,250 --> 00:06:20,580
古巴生产的好东西更感兴趣
in what's been coming out of Cuba.

162
00:06:22,080 --> 00:06:23,660
她难道不是最棒的吗
Is she the best or what?

163
00:06:23,830 --> 00:06:24,840
我们出去来一根吧
Shall we, hmm?

164
00:06:24,850 --> 00:06:25,790
走起
Let's do it.

165
00:06:26,820 --> 00:06:29,040
亲爱的 我们只是去谈工作的
You know what, honey? We are just gonna talk about work.

166
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:31,300
要不你留下再喝一杯
Why don't you stay and have another drink, huh?

167
00:06:31,340 --> 00:06:33,040
你不用扭我胳膊的
Well, you don't have to twist my arm.

168
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:35,380
女士们如何 再喝一轮蓝宝石之罪[鸡尾酒]
What do you say, ladies? Another round of Sapphire Sins?

169
00:06:35,380 --> 00:06:36,580
好的呀
Ooh, yes, please.

170
00:06:36,580 --> 00:06:38,590
菲尔 你太风趣了
Phil, you are just so much fun.

171
00:06:38,590 --> 00:06:39,470
谢谢
Thank you.

172
00:06:39,630 --> 00:06:41,330
从男人嘴里听到这句话
Oh, it is so nice to hear those words

173
00:06:41,330 --> 00:06:42,530
真是太好了
come out of a man's mouth.

174
00:06:42,530 --> 00:06:43,340
不就是嘛
Tell me about it.

175
00:06:43,340 --> 00:06:45,220
自从凯尔升了职
Ever since Kyle got that promotion,

176
00:06:45,440 --> 00:06:46,560
他就不怎么理我了
he barely acknowledges me.

177
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:48,620
拜托 他肯定知道自己有多幸运
Come on, now, I'm sure he knows how lucky he is.

178
00:06:48,620 --> 00:06:50,950
你生了双胞胎 把房子打理得一尘不染
You have the twins, a spotless house,

179
00:06:50,950 --> 00:06:52,850
还拥有线条完美的手臂
killer yoga arms.

180
00:06:53,370 --> 00:06:54,860
总是这样的
This happens all the time --

181
00:06:54,870 --> 00:06:56,370
他们走在通向成功的路上
They get on their track to success,

182
00:06:56,370 --> 00:06:58,340
我们就成了不被重视的家庭主妇
and you become the invisible housewife.

183
00:06:58,350 --> 00:07:00,170
我可不常有这种感觉
I don't know about all the time.

184
00:07:00,570 --> 00:07:02,190
跟那群女人坐在一起时 我在想
Sitting with all those gals, I thought,

185
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:05,030
"哇 这香水味儿可真浓得呛人"
"Wow, this is an insane amount of perfume."

186
00:07:05,030 --> 00:07:06,200
"还有 我是不是也逐渐"
"And also, am I on my way"

187
00:07:06,200 --> 00:07:08,270
"变成一个不被重视的家庭主妇"
"to becoming an invisible housewife?"

188
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:10,920
不可能 起码也会有征兆不是吗
No way. There'd be signs, right?

189
00:07:12,070 --> 00:07:14,430
回来啦 一直给你留着热菜呢
Hey, stranger. Been keeping dinner warm for ya.

190
00:07:14,430 --> 00:07:16,470
真好 不过我在俱乐部吃过牛排了
Oh, that's nice. I had a steak at the club.

191
00:07:16,470 --> 00:07:18,240
不过我想喝你手里那杯苏格兰威士忌
But I wouldn't knock a Scotch out of your hands.

192
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:19,210
没问题
Sure thing.

193
00:07:19,210 --> 00:07:20,510
现在是不是可以
Hey, is now an okay time

194
00:07:20,510 --> 00:07:22,340
过一遍这张家务清单
to go over this list of house stuff?

195
00:07:22,970 --> 00:07:23,810
看看呗
Let's see.

196
00:07:23,810 --> 00:07:27,010
随意 随意 找人解决 随意
Don't care, don't care, call a guy, don't care.

197
00:07:27,100 --> 00:07:29,700
猜猜是谁今天搞定西山社区的大单子了
Guess who got the big listing on Westmount today.

198
00:07:29,700 --> 00:07:32,430
太棒了 宝贝 工作能让你有点事干
Oh, that's great, sweetie. It'll keep you busy.

199
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,780
那是只新手镯吗
Is that a new bracelet?

200
00:07:35,780 --> 00:07:37,330
是的
Oh, yes, it is.

201
00:07:37,330 --> 00:07:39,770
吉姆上次和我大吵了之后买给我的
Jim bought it for me after our last big fight.

202
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:42,170
我怪他老是出差
I was on him about taking all those business trips.

203
00:07:42,170 --> 00:07:43,310
他们就这样
That's what they do.

204
00:07:43,310 --> 00:07:45,780
给你买新的珠宝首饰来哄你开心
Throw some new piece of jewelry at you to keep you happy.

205
00:07:45,780 --> 00:07:47,930
没错 倒也没什么可抱怨的
Mm-hmm. Not that I'm complaining.

206
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:52,560
没错吧
Right?

207
00:07:54,870 --> 00:07:56,050
太好了 老妈的车不在
Oh, good, Mom's car is gone.

208
00:07:56,050 --> 00:07:58,120
好 我的手锯在车库里
All right. My handsaw is in the garage.

209
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,510
你按住立模 我来把头锯掉
You'll hold her down, I'll cut the head off.

210
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:00,390
杰
Jay!

211
00:08:00,570 --> 00:08:02,880
我的车爆胎然后被拖走了
My car got a flat tire, so it got towed.

212
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:03,880
我得搭你的车去菲尔家
I need a ride to Phil's.

213
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:06,420
他在帮我搞定我的酱料网站
He's helping me finish my sauce website.

214
00:08:06,650 --> 00:08:08,350
曼尼 宝贝 你哭什么呢
Manny, baby, why are you crying?

215
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:09,290
我没哭
I'm not.

216
00:08:11,950 --> 00:08:14,040
商场又给我发邮件了
Ooh, I got another e-mail from the store.

217
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,540
准是我又卖了
I bet you that I sold another --

218
00:08:16,270 --> 00:08:18,740
搞什么鬼 有人偷了我的人形板
What the hell? Somebody stole my cutout.

219
00:08:18,740 --> 00:08:21,070
被人偷了 气死我也
Stolen? Damn it!

220
00:08:21,550 --> 00:08:22,930
重新换一个也没意义
Well, there's no point in replacing it

221
00:08:22,940 --> 00:08:24,760
反正换好了又要被偷
because it's just gonna get stolen again.

222
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:25,630
换不了了
I can't replace it.

223
00:08:25,630 --> 00:08:26,500
光是让机械臂正常动起来
It took two weeks

224
00:08:26,500 --> 00:08:29,360
就已经花了两个星期
just to get the mechanical arm working right.

225
00:08:29,640 --> 00:08:31,550
等着我抓到这个小贼吧
Oh, wait till I catch this rat.

226
00:08:31,550 --> 00:08:34,460
我一定会让他后悔偷了我的
I'm going to make him regret that he was ever...

227
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:36,010
杰 开开暖气吧
Hey, Jay, turn the heater on.

228
00:08:36,010 --> 00:08:38,100
我都能听到曼尼的牙齿在打颤
I can hear Manny's teeth chattering.

229
00:08:39,470 --> 00:08:40,860
什么声音
What is that noise?

230
00:08:41,210 --> 00:08:42,620
我没听到有声音
I don't hear anything.

231
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,940
怎么这么大声
What is that thumping noise?

232
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:48,290
曼尼 到车尾箱看看
Manny, go check the trunk.

233
00:08:48,290 --> 00:08:51,030
我不想弄脏手[蹚浑水] 杰
Uh, I don't really feel like getting my hands dirty, Jay.

234
00:08:51,030 --> 00:08:53,540
你的手已经很脏了 哥们儿
Your hands are plenty dirty already, buddy boy.

235
00:08:53,890 --> 00:08:55,040
快去看看[搞定]吧
Go deal with it.

236
00:08:55,300 --> 00:08:57,810
我一定要找出是谁干的 杰
I am going to find who did this, Jay,

237
00:08:58,380 --> 00:09:00,380
我会让他生不如死
and I'm going to make him hurt.

238
00:09:00,530 --> 00:09:03,070
所有窃贼都会出纰漏
Every thief makes a mistake.

239
00:09:03,160 --> 00:09:05,710
歌洛莉亚 你让这事影响到你心情了
Gloria, you're letting this get to you.

240
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:07,490
你知道什么能让你冷静下来吗
You know what always calms you down?

241
00:09:07,500 --> 00:09:08,870
乔爱听的小鸭之歌
Joe's little duck song.

242
00:09:08,870 --> 00:09:10,880
现在我们 我们来听吧
Now, let's -- Let's get that going.

243
00:09:11,230 --> 00:09:12,290
我恨他
I hate him.

244
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:18,310
*呱呱呱 加入小鸭游行队*
*Quack, quack, quack, join the duck parade*

245
00:09:18,310 --> 00:09:19,560
我要让他见血
I want blood!

246
00:09:19,560 --> 00:09:23,260
*摇摇摆摆 摇摇摆摆 不停地走*
*Waddle, waddle, waddle, waddle, watch them wade*

247
00:09:23,270 --> 00:09:25,010
*翘起尾巴 低下脑袋*
*Tail up, head down*

248
00:09:25,010 --> 00:09:27,080
*甩甩羽毛扭扭腰*
*Shake your feathers all around*

249
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:30,460
*大家都来开心地看小鸭游行队*
*Everybody's smiling at the duck parade*

250
00:09:31,470 --> 00:09:34,130
商场就发了个这么模糊的监控视频
This grainy security footage is all the store sent?

251
00:09:35,670 --> 00:09:37,880
我觉得我认识他 菲尔
I feel like I know him, Phil.

252
00:09:37,880 --> 00:09:39,730
不管他是谁 看着好像成心想被抓
Whoever it is, it looks like they want to get caught.

253
00:09:39,730 --> 00:09:41,460
他不停地回去拿奶酪块
He keeps going back for the cheese cubes.

254
00:09:41,460 --> 00:09:42,690
我不想再看了
I can't watch this anymore.

255
00:09:42,700 --> 00:09:44,910
-我们来弄我的网站 好吗 -好呀
- Let's just work on my website, okay? - Sure.

256
00:09:44,910 --> 00:09:46,620
菲尔 我约了客户要迟到了
Phil, I'm late for an appointment with a client.

257
00:09:46,620 --> 00:09:47,530
你能帮我个忙吗
Can you do me a favor?

258
00:09:47,530 --> 00:09:49,960
如果是把花放进浴室 我已经放好了
If it's to put flowers in the bathroom, I already did.

259
00:09:49,970 --> 00:09:51,580
我没注意到
Oh, I hadn't noticed.

260
00:09:51,580 --> 00:09:52,710
你注意到才怪
Not surprised.

261
00:09:52,710 --> 00:09:55,590
我本来该给这位客户带一瓶苏格兰威士忌
Okay, I was supposed to get this client a bottle of Scotch.

262
00:09:55,590 --> 00:09:57,430
可我一直没时间亲自去拿给他
I haven't had time to do it myself.

263
00:09:57,430 --> 00:09:59,720
你能拿一瓶送到我办公室去吗
So can you pick one up and bring it down to the office?

264
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:00,390
没问题
Whatever you need.

265
00:10:00,390 --> 00:10:02,120
我反正要出门理个发
I have to go out for a haircut anyway.

266
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:02,730
太好了
Great.

267
00:10:02,730 --> 00:10:04,430
只不过我昨天已经理过发了
Except I got a haircut yesterday.

268
00:10:04,430 --> 00:10:07,310
好 厨房真乱 对吧
Okay, wow. This kitchen really is a mess, huh?

269
00:10:07,690 --> 00:10:08,650
我走了
I'm off.

270
00:10:08,730 --> 00:10:09,700
别拍我屁股
Don't.

271
00:10:12,620 --> 00:10:14,360
抱歉 歌洛莉亚
Excuse me, Gloria.

272
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:17,070
很明显我不懂该怎么保持厨房整洁
Apparently, I don't know how to keep a kitchen clean.

273
00:10:17,070 --> 00:10:17,980
那是什么
What is that?

274
00:10:17,980 --> 00:10:19,210
这是个小小的封口礼物
Oh, it's just a little hush-up gift

275
00:10:19,220 --> 00:10:21,980
好让大权在握的妻子对我感到心安理得
from my powerful wife who thinks she can take me for granted.

276
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:24,810
然后我就继续像个小狗狗一样围着她转
And I'll just hover after her like a little puppy dog.

277
00:10:24,810 --> 00:10:27,470
你不能再这么忍着了
You have to stop putting up with it.

278
00:10:27,700 --> 00:10:30,100
他们不是故意的 但这种忽视只会愈演愈烈
They don't mean to ignore you, but it will only get worse.

279
00:10:30,100 --> 00:10:32,320
我刚嫁给杰那时候
One time when I had just married Jay,

280
00:10:32,330 --> 00:10:35,240
曾花一整天时间做他最爱吃的晚餐
I spent a whole day cooking his favorite dinner.

281
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:37,290
威灵顿牛排和带配料的焗土豆吗
Beef Wellington and a baked potato with all the fixin's?

282
00:10:37,290 --> 00:10:37,860
是的
Yes.

283
00:10:37,860 --> 00:10:41,600
但他回家后 根本没注意我做了什么
And then when he got home, he barely noticed what I have made.

284
00:10:41,610 --> 00:10:43,990
于是我就把他送我的绿宝石项链坠拿出来
So I took the emerald pendant that he had bought me

285
00:10:43,990 --> 00:10:46,780
他送我那个是因为错过了之前的三顿晚饭
for the three past dinners that he had missed

286
00:10:46,780 --> 00:10:48,620
我把吊坠扔他头上
and I threw it at his head.

287
00:10:48,620 --> 00:10:51,140
告诉他我不需要这些漂亮珠宝
I told him I don't need fancy things.

288
00:10:51,140 --> 00:10:52,440
我需要尊重
I need the respect.

289
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:54,040
你脖子上是个绿宝石吊坠吗
Isn't that an emerald pendant?

290
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:55,490
后来它又回到了我手里
It made its way back to me.

291
00:10:55,490 --> 00:10:58,740
但重点在于你得表达你的意见
But the point is that you have to make a statement.

292
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:01,100
你得把那个平衡板还回去
You have to give back the hoverboard.

293
00:11:01,340 --> 00:11:03,660
虽然我不想承认 但你说的对
You know what? I hate to admit it, but you're right.

294
00:11:05,770 --> 00:11:06,460
菲尔
Phil?

295
00:11:06,460 --> 00:11:06,940
有时会这样
This happens.

296
00:11:06,950 --> 00:11:08,690
只要等电池耗尽就好了
You just got to let the battery run out.

297
00:11:10,310 --> 00:11:12,140
邮票用完了 我要去趟邮局
We're out of stamps. I'm heading to the post office.

298
00:11:12,140 --> 00:11:12,880
要带点什么吗
Do you need anything?

299
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:13,880
不用了
No, I'm good.

300
00:11:14,060 --> 00:11:14,620
你在干吗
What are you doing?

301
00:11:14,620 --> 00:11:16,550
只是研究点东西
Oh, uh, just a little research.

302
00:11:16,670 --> 00:11:19,810
《威尔克森和成年汤米以及神秘行李箱》
"Wilkersons plus adults Tommy plus mysterious trunk."

303
00:11:19,810 --> 00:11:20,980
不如试着搜搜
Okay, now try Googling

304
00:11:20,980 --> 00:11:22,870
《荒谬的闲人以及同性恋》
"Irrational meddling plus homosexual."

305
00:11:22,870 --> 00:11:25,500
米奇尔 万一他们来自什么奇怪的邪教呢
Okay, Mitchell, what if they're a part of some weird cult?

306
00:11:25,500 --> 00:11:26,860
记得我们看的那个片子吗
Remember that "20/20" we watched

307
00:11:26,860 --> 00:11:28,970
他们在里面潜入那个宗教仪式
where they infiltrated the ritual ceremony

308
00:11:28,990 --> 00:11:32,020
伊丽莎白·瓦尔加斯差点被迫拿一只松鼠献祭
and Elizabeth Vargas had to almost sacrifice a squirrel?

309
00:11:32,020 --> 00:11:34,620
我检查了他们扔在垃圾桶里的袋子
I went through the bag they dumped in the trash.

310
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,590
你还把咱闺女牵扯进来了
Now you're involving our daughter?

311
00:11:38,590 --> 00:11:40,370
我不知道她在说啥
I don't know what she's talking about.

312
00:11:41,550 --> 00:11:43,150
好吧 你得离开这间屋子
Okay, you know what? You need to get out of the house.

313
00:11:43,150 --> 00:11:44,470
你去买邮票
Go get the stamps.

314
00:11:44,470 --> 00:11:45,490
再找个新爱好
And a hobby.

315
00:11:46,110 --> 00:11:47,910
他们在我们家里
Okay, well, they're in our home,

316
00:11:47,910 --> 00:11:50,190
我只是在保护我们的家
and I'm just trying to protect our family.

317
00:11:50,230 --> 00:11:51,620
我可不想哪天醒来发现自己死了
I don't want to wake up dead.

318
00:11:51,620 --> 00:11:52,950
真不敢相信我得再跟你说一遍
I can't believe I have to say this to you again.

319
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:54,430
死人怎么会醒过来
You cannot wake up and be dead.

320
00:11:54,430 --> 00:11:55,410
我就那么一说
It's an expression!

321
00:11:55,410 --> 00:11:56,330
才不是
It's not.

322
00:11:56,780 --> 00:11:58,720
大爸不该让你跟他一起窥探别人
Daddy should not have involved you in his snooping.

323
00:11:58,720 --> 00:12:01,170
那你不想让我告诉你我找到什么了吗
So you don't want me to tell you what I found in here?

324
00:12:01,330 --> 00:12:02,350
不想
No...

325
00:12:02,700 --> 00:12:04,380
我当然都查看过了
Well, of course I looked.

326
00:12:04,380 --> 00:12:08,080
我在袋子里发现了乳胶手套 一瓶漂白剂
And inside I found latex gloves, a bottle of bleach,

327
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:09,250
高强度防水布
heavy-duty tarp.

328
00:12:09,250 --> 00:12:11,270
我从来没有杀人然后毁尸灭迹的经验
Now, I've never killed anyone and cleaned it up,

329
00:12:11,270 --> 00:12:12,940
但那包东西好像就是干这个的
but that sounds like a kit.

330
00:12:13,460 --> 00:12:14,820
所以我看到他们开着那辆没窗户的
So as soon as I saw them drive off

331
00:12:14,820 --> 00:12:17,650
杀人必备面包车离开时 我立刻跑上楼
in their windowless murder van, I-I ran upstairs.

332
00:12:21,160 --> 00:12:22,480
我的天
Oh, my God!

333
00:12:25,130 --> 00:12:26,550
这是什么
What are you?

334
00:12:37,020 --> 00:12:38,740
那些人回来了
The people are back!

335
00:12:40,990 --> 00:12:43,480
每天都要来这么一出吗 汤米
Is this gonna be a daily thing now, Tommy,

336
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:44,940
又忘拿手机
losing your phone?

337
00:12:47,390 --> 00:12:48,630
谢天谢地
Oh, thank God.

338
00:12:49,170 --> 00:12:52,000
等等 你去哪
Wait. Where are you going?

339
00:13:01,020 --> 00:13:03,840
啥事儿 我还在买邮票呢
Um, what's up? I'm still getting stamps.

340
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:05,070
看你左边
Look to your left.

341
00:13:05,850 --> 00:13:06,900
你在那干啥
What are you doing?

342
00:13:06,900 --> 00:13:08,190
我在隐蔽自己 他们在屋里
I'm hiding. They're here.

343
00:13:08,190 --> 00:13:09,780
我上来是想看看有没有什么诡异的事发生
I came up to see if anything weird was going on.

344
00:13:09,780 --> 00:13:12,100
是吗 你也好奇了 有点想管闲事吗
Did ya? Were you curious? Gettin' a little nosy?

345
00:13:12,100 --> 00:13:12,980
现在不是时候
Not the time.

346
00:13:12,980 --> 00:13:14,920
这些诡异的东西是啥
What are these creepy things?

347
00:13:15,580 --> 00:13:17,320
如果这些玩偶会说话
If these dolls could talk...

348
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:19,480
他们会揭发我碰掉了一个而且头还摔掉了
They'd tell you I dropped one and then their head came off.

349
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:20,630
你得把它放回去
Well, you have to put it back.

350
00:13:20,630 --> 00:13:22,320
说不定他们不会注意到丢了一个
Maybe they won't notice one of them's missing.

351
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:24,330
没错 这真像个正常的兴趣爱好
Yeah, this seems like a casual interest.

352
00:13:25,590 --> 00:13:26,330
我的天 他们来了
Oh my gosh, here they come.

353
00:13:26,340 --> 00:13:28,740
我来分散他们的注意好让你溜回去
Okay, I'll create a distraction so you can get back in there.

354
00:13:28,740 --> 00:13:31,850
我只是邀请他们来享受一会儿鸡尾酒
I simply invited them to a complimentary cocktail hour.

355
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:34,470
就算可能是撒旦崇拜者也喜欢三层奶油乳酪
Even possible Satanists enjoy a triple-cream Brie

356
00:13:34,470 --> 00:13:36,030
配清爽的霞多丽酒
and a crisp Chardonnay.

357
00:13:36,460 --> 00:13:37,990
什么风把你们吹到这个镇上的
So, what brings you all to town?

358
00:13:37,990 --> 00:13:40,620
我们是来参加微笑密友大会的
We're here for the Chuckled Chums Convention.

359
00:13:40,620 --> 00:13:43,580
抱歉我没听懂 微 微笑密友是啥
I'm sorry, the -- the Chuckled Chums?

360
00:13:43,590 --> 00:13:45,720
它们是一类陶瓷塑像
They're a line of ceramic figurines.

361
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:47,860
我们是狂热的收藏者
We're avid collectors.

362
00:13:51,770 --> 00:13:53,340
好像很有趣
Well, that sounds fun.

363
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:54,240
是的
Yeah.

364
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:57,240
我们每年都和志同道合的密友爱好者聚在一起
Every year we gather together with like-minded Chum lovers

365
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:59,720
相互欣赏最爱的藏品
to share our favorite pieces.

366
00:13:59,850 --> 00:14:01,180
什么 你 你是想说
Yes? You -- You want to say s--

367
00:14:01,180 --> 00:14:02,040
阿嚏[救命]
Help!

368
00:14:02,210 --> 00:14:03,790
愿你健康 亲爱的
Oh, bless you, darling.

369
00:14:03,790 --> 00:14:07,070
你们可能猜到了 我是个塑像修复师
You've probably guessed. I'm the figurine restorer.

370
00:14:07,070 --> 00:14:08,280
我们好激动
We're so excited.

371
00:14:08,280 --> 00:14:10,270
我们的藏品是今年大会的重头戏
Ours is this year's featured collection

372
00:14:10,270 --> 00:14:12,760
因为它的型号和完好的品相
because of its size and pristine condition.

373
00:14:12,820 --> 00:14:16,420
我希望我们的工业抛光机没有太吵到你们
I hope the industrial polisher we brought wasn't too loud.

374
00:14:16,430 --> 00:14:19,250
没有 我们根本听不见楼上有任何声音
No, we can't hear anything that goes on upstairs.

375
00:14:21,990 --> 00:14:22,690
好的
Okay.

376
00:14:23,250 --> 00:14:24,190
这就行了
All right.

377
00:14:24,810 --> 00:14:25,890
不
Oh, no.

378
00:14:27,540 --> 00:14:29,770
不 不 不 不 不 不 不
No, no, no, no, no! No, no, no, no, no!

379
00:14:29,770 --> 00:14:30,910
不 不 不 不
No, no! No, no, no!

380
00:14:30,910 --> 00:14:33,470
天啊 不要
Oh, God, no!

381
00:14:35,450 --> 00:14:36,470
幸好 要重新集一套
Fortunately, Chuckle Chums

382
00:14:36,470 --> 00:14:38,420
微笑密友并不是那么贵
aren't all that expensive to replace.

383
00:14:38,420 --> 00:14:39,540
它们主要是那些孤独的人们
They're mainly just an excuse

384
00:14:39,540 --> 00:14:41,150
出来结交朋友的一个由头
for lonely people to go outside.

385
00:14:41,150 --> 00:14:43,600
关键是我们吸取了教训 再也不窥私了
Point is, we learned our lesson. No more snooping.

386
00:14:43,600 --> 00:14:44,340
完全正确
Absolutely.

387
00:14:44,340 --> 00:14:46,660
不过我们依然解释不了
Although we still don't have an explanation

388
00:14:46,660 --> 00:14:49,210
那些半夜咯吱作响的地板是怎么回事
for those creaky floorboards in the middle of the night.

389
00:14:49,300 --> 00:14:52,220
脚步沉重的出去 轻盈的回来
Heavy-footed going one way, light coming back.

390
00:14:52,640 --> 00:14:56,000
难道汤米加入他们是为了构建三人家庭
Was it Tommy joining his chums for a menage a trois,

391
00:14:56,190 --> 00:14:58,840
然后每晚和威尔克森夫人交换床位
then being replaced by Mrs. Wilkerson on the couch?

392
00:14:58,840 --> 00:15:01,050
好吧 你需要 帮助
Okay, you need... help!

393
00:15:02,170 --> 00:15:03,440
该死的
Son of a bitch.

394
00:15:03,620 --> 00:15:05,260
这玩意一上午了废了我两把剪刀
I broke two saw blades on this thing,

395
00:15:05,260 --> 00:15:06,970
现在这把神剪也快完蛋了
and now these miracle shears are no good.

396
00:15:06,970 --> 00:15:08,630
在门口卖给我剪刀那家伙
Guy who sold me these at the front door

397
00:15:08,630 --> 00:15:09,510
用它剪开了马蹄铁
cut through a horseshoe.

398
00:15:09,510 --> 00:15:10,780
坚持住 我们来试试碎纸机
Hold on. Let's try your shredder.

399
00:15:10,780 --> 00:15:12,040
这东西怎么会在这儿
What's that doing down here anyway?

400
00:15:12,040 --> 00:15:13,460
我对乔的一些不重要的美术作品
I made an executive decision

401
00:15:13,460 --> 00:15:15,090
做出了一项处理决定
about some of Joe's lesser artwork.

402
00:15:15,090 --> 00:15:16,190
帮我把它抬起来
Help me lift this thing.

403
00:15:19,690 --> 00:15:20,560
这个管用
Hey, it's working!

404
00:15:20,570 --> 00:15:22,030
这是市面上能用钱买到最好的碎纸机
The best shredder money can buy.

405
00:15:22,030 --> 00:15:24,440
2004年 我们机密的阻滞技术文件
In 2004, our whisper-close hamper technology

406
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:27,500
被人从垃圾桶里翻出来 放到黑市上卖了
got stolen out of the trash, got sold on the dark web.

407
00:15:27,560 --> 00:15:28,320
绝不能再次发生
Never again.

408
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:30,140
不 卡住了
Oh, no, it's stuck!

409
00:15:30,680 --> 00:15:31,900
我回来了
Hola!

410
00:15:35,630 --> 00:15:36,970
你这么早就回来了
Hey, you're back early, huh?

411
00:15:36,980 --> 00:15:38,970
是啊 我不想回到商店里触景生情
Yeah, I didn't want to go back to that store

412
00:15:38,970 --> 00:15:40,310
再为那件事生气
and get angry again.

413
00:15:40,310 --> 00:15:41,440
我只想好好放松下
I just want to relax.

414
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:42,220
也是
Yeah.

415
00:15:42,550 --> 00:15:43,460
曼尼
Manny!

416
00:15:44,370 --> 00:15:45,510
怎么了 妈妈
Uh, yes, Mama?

417
00:15:45,510 --> 00:15:46,960
你能帮我准备下洗澡水
Can you please draw me a bath

418
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:49,200
放点你的浴盐进去吗
with those fancy bath salts that you have?

419
00:15:49,210 --> 00:15:50,750
那些高级浴盐是留给特殊场合
Oh, I usually save those for spec--

420
00:15:50,750 --> 00:15:51,980
赶紧去准备洗澡水
Just draw the damn bath.

421
00:15:52,010 --> 00:15:53,580
我帮你倒杯好酒你边泡边喝吧
I'll get you a nice glass of wine to go with it.

422
00:15:53,580 --> 00:15:54,890
-好啊 -开心点 亲爱的
- Oh, okay. - Come on, honey,

423
00:15:54,890 --> 00:15:56,890
我这有瓶白葡萄酒你肯定会喜欢
I got a nice Chardonnay out here you're gonna like.

424
00:15:56,890 --> 00:15:58,110
斯黛拉在门外吗
Is that Stella?

425
00:15:58,110 --> 00:15:59,380
肯定不是
No, definitely not.

426
00:16:01,140 --> 00:16:02,120
你给我带什么来啦
What did you bring?

427
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:03,000
歌洛莉亚 等等
Gloria, wait.

428
00:16:04,440 --> 00:16:05,590
歌洛莉亚 先别生气
Gloria, don't be mad.

429
00:16:05,810 --> 00:16:10,100
肯定是爱丽丝姑姑那个老妖婆
It must have been that old witch, Auntie Alice!

430
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:12,360
她肯定是想先用这个警告我
She must have left this as a warning!

431
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:13,320
恶婆娘
Devious.

432
00:16:13,490 --> 00:16:16,010
好了 这下上面也有我的指纹了
Dang it, I got my fingerprints all over it now.

433
00:16:16,010 --> 00:16:19,480
我敢打包票车胎也是她扎坏的
I bet she was the one who gave me that flat tire.

434
00:16:20,690 --> 00:16:21,600
给谁打电话呢
Who are you calling?

435
00:16:29,400 --> 00:16:30,230
谁啊
Who was that?

436
00:16:31,470 --> 00:16:32,240
她要付出代价了
She's going to pay.

437
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:33,520
你都不确定到底是不是她
You don't even know it was her.

438
00:16:33,640 --> 00:16:34,880
不管怎么样 你先叫那人住手
Whatever that was, you got to call it off.

439
00:16:34,890 --> 00:16:37,130
肯定是她 她眼神看着就不对劲
I know it was her. I saw the evil in her eyes.

440
00:16:37,130 --> 00:16:38,520
万一人家有白内障呢
She probably has cataracts.

441
00:16:39,180 --> 00:16:40,930
好吧 歌洛莉亚 是我干的
Oh, for God's sake, Gloria, I did it.

442
00:16:40,930 --> 00:16:42,530
人形板是我偷的
I stole the cutout.

443
00:16:42,530 --> 00:16:42,970
是你
You?

444
00:16:42,970 --> 00:16:45,950
看那些男的在那猥琐地合影我就不爽
I didn't love the way those guys were taking pictures with it.

445
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:47,860
杰 但你从来不会这样吃醋的啊
Jay, but you've never been jealous like this.

446
00:16:47,860 --> 00:16:49,120
一开始看到是不会吃醋
Well, when we first met,

447
00:16:49,130 --> 00:16:51,100
但他们天天把你的牌子放在那
but then I realized it's a full-time job.

448
00:16:51,140 --> 00:16:51,880
是我不好
I'm sorry.

449
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:55,310
想保护自己的老婆有什么不好的呢
There's nothing wrong with being protective of your wife.

450
00:16:55,340 --> 00:16:56,810
这意味着你在乎我啊
It means that you care.

451
00:16:56,810 --> 00:16:59,120
这会儿不会有人去对那老太太做什么吧
Is something bad happening to that poor woman?

452
00:16:59,120 --> 00:17:01,130
细节我也不知道 我都交给他们去办了
I don't know details. I let them decide.

453
00:17:01,130 --> 00:17:02,420
他们那帮人不喜欢被指手画脚
They don't like to feel managed.

454
00:17:02,420 --> 00:17:05,060
求求你赶紧叫他们停手吧
I'm begging you to make that call!

455
00:17:05,170 --> 00:17:07,720
爱丽丝姑姑还来过我们高中做过讲座呢
Auntie Alice spoke at Career Day at my high school!

456
00:17:09,010 --> 00:17:09,840
你好
Hello?

457
00:17:10,730 --> 00:17:12,080
没 我们没订花啊
No, we didn't order flowers.

458
00:17:12,080 --> 00:17:14,410
就是他们 就说不要郁金香
That's them. Tell them no tulips.

459
00:17:14,410 --> 00:17:16,000
不要郁金香
Uh, no tulips.

460
00:17:17,080 --> 00:17:17,880
他们挂了
They hung up.

461
00:17:17,950 --> 00:17:19,980
还好老娘记得这些黑话
Good thing that I remembered the code.

462
00:17:20,390 --> 00:17:22,490
好了 我的老醋坛子
Okay, now, my big jealous man,

463
00:17:22,490 --> 00:17:24,390
咱们喝点酒去吧
let's go and have some wine.

464
00:17:24,500 --> 00:17:26,670
我也不知道为什么会对人形板耿耿于怀
I don't know why that cutout bugged me so much.

465
00:17:26,670 --> 00:17:29,430
也许退休后我太闲了才有空吃醋
I guess probably because I have more time now to be jealous.

466
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:31,630
好了好了 你闲的话就把我带上楼去
Okay, now, you have more time to take me upstairs

467
00:17:31,630 --> 00:17:33,340
给我演示下
and show me what those

468
00:17:33,350 --> 00:17:35,820
那些臭男人都在商店对我做了什么吧
bad men were doing to me at the store.

469
00:17:35,820 --> 00:17:38,000
我又重新爱上退休生活了
I'm getting back to liking retirement.

470
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:41,750
我是让你说的不要玫瑰 对吧
I told you to say no roses, right?

471
00:17:41,820 --> 00:17:42,830
你说郁金香
Tulips!

472
00:17:43,850 --> 00:17:44,700
应该差不多啦
I'm sure it's fine.

473
00:17:47,290 --> 00:17:49,150
这是你要的威士忌
Here's the scotch you asked for.

474
00:17:51,890 --> 00:17:53,420
我还有些话想跟你说
And also, there's something else.

475
00:17:53,880 --> 00:17:55,150
我要把滑板车退回去了
I'm returning the hoverboard.

476
00:17:55,150 --> 00:17:57,230
好吧 发票应该在盒子里
Fine. I-I think the receipt was in the box.

477
00:17:57,230 --> 00:17:59,400
好的 行
Okay. Well, good.

478
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:01,310
因为我希望得到的尊重和肯定
Because I can't accept a gift if it's just a shiny

479
00:18:01,310 --> 00:18:04,180
不是这种高级玩具能替代的
servo-controlled substitute for respect and appreciation.

480
00:18:04,620 --> 00:18:06,440
看看我吧 克莱尔
I'm not invisible, Claire.

481
00:18:06,620 --> 00:18:08,250
你老公是一位强壮能干的
You married a strong and capable man who --

482
00:18:08,260 --> 00:18:09,930
你能帮我把链子解开吗
Can you help me with this clasp?

483
00:18:10,530 --> 00:18:11,330
克莱尔
Claire?

484
00:18:12,470 --> 00:18:13,260
亲爱的
Honey?

485
00:18:13,260 --> 00:18:14,760
别 别哭啊
No. Don't cry.

486
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:16,640
你非要我留着也不是不可以啊
I-I can, uh -- I can keep it if you want.

487
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:18,760
反正也没法退 都有磨损了
I-I can't return it anyway. I already dented it.

488
00:18:18,760 --> 00:18:20,880
不 不是这事
No, it's not that. It's -- it's not.

489
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:23,270
是工作的事 我压力好大
It's just all of this. I'm so stressed.

490
00:18:23,270 --> 00:18:25,180
菲尔 我从没当过老板
Phil, I've never been a boss before,

491
00:18:25,180 --> 00:18:26,560
我都要疯了
and I am freaking out.

492
00:18:26,560 --> 00:18:27,900
但目前为止你表现得很棒啊
But you've been handled it so well.

493
00:18:27,910 --> 00:18:30,270
都是装出来的 我自己都不知道在做什么
I am faking it, Phil. I have no idea what I'm doing.

494
00:18:30,270 --> 00:18:32,370
我只是在模仿我爸
I'm just copying my dad --

495
00:18:32,370 --> 00:18:34,530
牛排啊 威士忌啊 还有雪茄
the steak, the scotch, the cigars.

496
00:18:34,530 --> 00:18:36,530
你知道我的胃有多烧得慌吗
Do you have any idea how bad the heartburn is?

497
00:18:36,530 --> 00:18:38,360
但你才刚上手啊 慢慢来
But you just got here. Give it a little time.

498
00:18:38,360 --> 00:18:40,130
哪有时间慢慢来 我现在是老大
There is no time. I'm in charge now.

499
00:18:40,130 --> 00:18:41,990
我每天都活在恐惧中
And I live every day in constant fear

500
00:18:41,990 --> 00:18:43,590
生怕被人发现我自欺欺人
of everyone discovering that I'm a fraud.

501
00:18:43,590 --> 00:18:45,820
我的天 我果真是个强势的白人男性
Oh, my God, I really am a powerful white male!

502
00:18:45,820 --> 00:18:48,280
听着 你没有自欺欺人
Hey, you are not a fraud.

503
00:18:48,940 --> 00:18:49,970
我连坐上我爸椅子的
I haven't had the guts

504
00:18:49,970 --> 00:18:52,860
胆儿都没有
to sit at my dad's desk since he left.

505
00:18:53,090 --> 00:18:54,980
我依然觉得自己只是当年
I still feel like the little girl

506
00:18:54,990 --> 00:18:56,890
那个在桌子底下玩躲猫猫的小姑娘
who used to play hide-and-seek under it.

507
00:18:57,520 --> 00:18:58,270
听着
Look.

508
00:18:59,710 --> 00:19:01,210
现在这是你的桌子了
This is your desk now.

509
00:19:01,210 --> 00:19:02,390
是你应得的
You've earned it.

510
00:19:03,600 --> 00:19:06,080
你不是当年那个小姑娘了
You are not a little girl anymore.

511
00:19:08,900 --> 00:19:11,690
事实上 你是我认识的
In fact, you're the strongest,

512
00:19:11,690 --> 00:19:13,510
最强大最聪明的女人
smartest woman I know.

513
00:19:14,710 --> 00:19:17,100
维持咱们一大家子生活起居是最难的事业
The hardest company in the world to run is Dunphy Co.,

514
00:19:17,100 --> 00:19:19,380
你都能坚持22年
and you've kept us in business for 22 years.

515
00:19:19,940 --> 00:19:21,380
我一点也不担心你工作受阻
I don't worry about you in this job.

516
00:19:21,380 --> 00:19:24,050
我还担心那些笨蛋追赶你的步伐太辛苦呢
I worry about the poor chump who has to follow you.

517
00:19:24,410 --> 00:19:26,420
克莱尔 人都到齐可以开会了
Everyone is here for your meeting, Claire.

518
00:19:26,940 --> 00:19:28,130
给他们点颜色吧 老大
Knock 'em dead, boss.

519
00:19:28,130 --> 00:19:30,260
菲尔 等等
Uh, Phil, wait.

520
00:19:30,930 --> 00:19:31,850
抱歉
Oh, sorry.

521
00:19:32,060 --> 00:19:32,910
多谢
Thank you...

522
00:19:35,600 --> 00:19:36,450
你做的一切
for everything.

523
00:19:36,450 --> 00:19:37,290
真心感谢
Thank you.

524
00:19:37,290 --> 00:19:39,290
很抱歉我很少跟你言谢
And I'm sorry if I don't say it more.

525
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:40,470
抱抱
Come here.

526
00:19:41,510 --> 00:19:44,750
我猜你又要去会议上挥斥方遒了
I guess you want to get rolling on your meeting.

527
00:19:45,630 --> 00:19:47,490
我就先走了
I'll just duck out.

528
00:19:47,500 --> 00:19:49,040
-滑板留着吧 -谢谢
-Take it. -Thank you.

529
00:19:53,490 --> 00:19:54,310
克莱尔
Claire?

530
00:19:56,690 --> 00:19:57,630
我爱你
I love you.

531
00:20:12,140 --> 00:20:13,240
好了 玛格丽特
Okay, Margaret.

532
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:14,690
别动别动 让我转吧
No, no, no, no, no, let me spin!

533
00:20:14,690 --> 00:20:16,170
你会帮倒忙的
It's worse if you try to help.

534
00:20:17,190 --> 00:20:18,170
叫他们进来吧
Send them in.

535
00:20:36,950 --> 00:20:37,870
菲尔
Phil?

536
00:20:38,090 --> 00:20:40,030
不是吧 又来
Oh, no, not again.

537
00:20:48,080 --> 00:20:49,140
要把他叫醒吗
Should we wake him up?

538
00:20:49,140 --> 00:20:50,370
我看注意事项了
Oh, I read the instructions.

539
00:20:50,370 --> 00:20:51,700
说最好不要
It says not to.

540
00:20:54,590 --> 00:20:55,470
你好
Hello.

541
00:20:56,790 --> 00:20:57,610
什么
What?

542
00:20:58,390 --> 00:21:00,420
别担心 我是房屋中介
Don't worry. I'm a realtor.

543
00:21:19,500 --> 00:21:20,620
我马上就到
I'll be right there.

544
00:21:24,540 --> 00:21:26,020
我明天要早起开会
I have a really early meeting.

545
00:21:26,100 --> 00:21:26,540
我去吧
I'm on it.

546
00:21:26,740 --> 00:21:27,280
谢谢
Thank you.
